    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "So when you talk about those irregular, inharmonic partials that don't align with the integer multiples, how do they actually manifest in the sound? It sounds like they almost act like separate, uninvited entities within the tone itself. Is there a way to describe how those \"unwanted\" frequencies interact with the fundamental?",
